# CR 704.5: destroyZeroLoyalty is battle-zero-defense-destroyed's own
# counterpart for a planeswalker -- a planeswalker at zero or less loyalty
# goes to its owner's graveyard, checked at every state-based-action pass.
# StartTurn's own Untap-step beginPhase is the first one, so no advance is
# needed to reach it. LOYALTY=0 is set directly here since this places the
# card by setup.state (Game.NewCard), not through a real cast that would
# have given it its printed 5 loyalty via Move.
startturn human
